lass=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">牧師</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼくし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">牧师；牧者；神职人员</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">殊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>特别；尤其；格外</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">特殊</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とくしゅ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">特殊；特别；独特；独有</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">殊に</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ことに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">尤其；特别；格外；最重要的是；另外；此外</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">殖</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>增加；繁殖；增殖</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふ.える・ふ.やす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">殖える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">增加；增多；增长</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">繁殖</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんしょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">繁殖；增殖；繁衍；增加</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">艦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>军舰</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">軍艦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぐんかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">军舰；战舰</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">輩</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>伙伴；同辈；人们；同类</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">-ばら・やから・やかい・ともがら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">先輩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せんぱい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">前辈；上级；年长者；前任</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">後輩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうはい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">后辈；晚辈；年轻同事；年轻学生</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">穴</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>洞穴；孔；缝隙；巢穴；窝</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">穴</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">孔；洞；开口；穿孔；坑；凹陷；洞穴；窟窿；洞穴；兽穴；巢穴；窝；亏损；缺口；财务漏洞；损失；空缺；空位；空档；缺位；漏洞；缺陷；不足；薄弱环节；破绽；鲜为人知的好地方；隐藏的秘密；冷门；爆冷；黑马；包厢；隔间式座席（传统日式剧院的地板座位）；躲藏处；隐蔽处；藏身之地</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">奇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>奇怪；奇异；珍奇；好奇</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">