 lang=\"ja\">はか.る・たばか.る・はかりごと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">暖</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>温暖；暖和；加热；保温</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ダン・ノン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あたた.か・あたた.かい・あたた.まる・あたた.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">暖かい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あたたかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">温暖；温和；（令人舒适的）炎热；体贴；亲切；和蔼；（颜色）温暖的；柔和的；手头宽裕；富裕</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">暖房</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だんぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（室内）供暖；暖气</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">温暖</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おんだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">温暖；温和；暖和</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">昌</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>繁荣；明亮；清晰</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さかん</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">拍</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>拍子（音乐节拍）；击掌</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハク・ヒョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">拍手</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はくしゅ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拍手；鼓掌；（在神社参拜时）拍手祈祷；击掌参拜</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">朗</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>明亮；晴朗；开朗；清晰；悦耳</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほが.らか・あき.らか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">朗らか</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほがらか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">开朗的；欢快的；明快的；悦耳的；（天空、日子等）晴朗的；明亮的；万里无云的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">明朗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めいろう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">开朗；明快；爽朗；清楚；透明；光明正大；公正</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">朗読</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろうどく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">朗读；诵读</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">寛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>宽裕；放松；宽容；宽敞；缓和</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くつろ.ぐ・ひろ.い・ゆる.やか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寛容</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">宽容；思想开明；忍耐；慷慨；宽宏大量</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">胞</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>细胞；同胞；胎盘；囊；鞘</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ホウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">細胞</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">细胞；细胞（组织中的基层单位，尤指共产党内的）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">泣</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>哭泣；啼哭；呜咽</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">な.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">泣く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">哭泣；流泪；啜泣；遭受苦难；为…所困扰；经历艰辛；勉强接受（无理要求、损失等）；忍痛承担；做出牺牲；有负盛名；声誉受损；蒙羞；哀叹；悲叹；痛惜</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">隔</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>隔开；距离；隔离；交替</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">へだ.てる・へだ.たる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">間隔</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんかく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">间隔；间距；空格；空白符</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">隔てる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へだてる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">隔开；分隔；隔离；分离；插在...之间；夹在中间；使疏远；使产生隔阂</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">隔週</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かくしゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">每隔一周；隔周</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">浄</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>清净；净化；驱邪；清朝</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョウ・セイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">きよ.める・きよ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">没</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>沉没；溺死；消失；隐没；死亡</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボツ・モツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おぼ.れる・しず.む・ない</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">沈没</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちんぼつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">沉没；下沉；浸没；烂醉；酩酊大醉；沉湎；贪恋（尤指在风月场所等）而荒废工作；长期逗留；在一个地方待很久</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">没収</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼっしゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">没收；扣押；查封；充公</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">没落</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼつらく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">衰落；衰败；崩溃；破产</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">暇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>空闲；闲暇；休假；告辞；请假</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひま・いとま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">暇</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いとま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">空闲时间；闲暇；休假；休息；假期；假日；辞职；解雇；离婚；离别；告别；辞行</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">休暇</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">假期；休假；休息日；请假；留职停薪假</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">余暇</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">闲暇；闲暇时间；空闲时间</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">肺</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>肺</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">肺</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">肺</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">貞</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>贞节；正直；恒定；正义</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ・ジョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ただし.い・さだ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">靖</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>和平；安定</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ジョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やす.んじる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鑑</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>鉴定；鉴赏；借鉴；榜样（模范）；印鉴</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かんが.みる・かがみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鑑賞</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">欣赏；鉴赏；品赏</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">図鑑</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ずかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">图鉴；图解参考书；鉴别手册；野外指南</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">印鑑</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いんかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">印章；印鉴</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">飼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>饲养；驯养；喂养</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">か.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">飼う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">饲养；饲育；养；喂养</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">飼育</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しいく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">饲养；饲育；养殖</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">陰</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>阴影；阴（阴阳）；阴性；阴部；秘密</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かげ・かげ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">陰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かげ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">阴影；荫；背后；另一侧；后面；幕后；暗处；背地里；阴郁；阴沉；晦暗</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">日陰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひかげ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">阴凉处；阴影；阳光；日光</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">陰気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いんき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">阴沉；沉闷；悲惨；忧郁；阴气</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">銘</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" 